Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:04:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compose): redraw reactivated lazy slots

A retained lazy slot taken back from the reusable pool, or a precomposed
slot activated by a later measure, can be stranded dirty behind a clean
slot container, so hidden descendants never flush visible. Force the draw
invalidation through the ancestry on slot activation and when a descendant's
visibility is restored. Both hooks also cover #1422 paused precomposition.

